            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем не­ра­вен­ство:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\left(5\\cdot 0{,}2^{x+0{,}5}-0{,}2\\cdot 5^{x+0{,}5}\\right)\\left(\\log_{0{,}2}^{2}(x+0{,}5)-2\\log_{5}(x+0{,}5)\\right)&gt;0\\Leftrightarrow\\left(5^{1-x}-5^{x}\\right)\\left(\\log_{5}^{2}(x+0{,}5)-2\\log_{5}(x+0{,}5)\\right)&gt;0.\"></span></p><p></p></center><p>Об­ласть опре­де­ле­ния не­ра­вен­ства за­да­ет­ся усло­ви­ем <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\gt -\\frac{1}{2}\"></span> . Най­дем нули мно­жи­те­лей:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"5^{1-x}=5^{x}\\iff 1-x=x\\iff x=\\frac{1}{2}\"></span> . <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_5 (x+0{,}5)(\\log_5 (x+0{,}5)-2)=0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\log_5 (x+0{,}5)=0\\\\\\log_5 (x+0{,}5)=2\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{49}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</p><p><span></span></p></center><p>При­ме­ним метод ин­тер­ва­лов, по­лу­чим ответ:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{1}{2}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{1}{2}\"></span>  или  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{49}{2}\"></span> .</p><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"13d16df3-0455-4939-9ab7-fe32af69035f\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p>",
